<dispatchitem code="00008540.0001001" func-code="25-20-09" item-list-nbr="09" revdate="2026-08-19T00:00:00"><title>Cabin Attendant Seat</title><functional-notes><note code="00008540.0001001.001" layer="1" lid="N.00008540.0001001.001"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008540.0001001.002">A cabin attendant seat with
