inoperative.</para></note></functional-notes><ditembody nb-installed="-"><dispcond code="00008540.0001001.002" dispcond-id="D03237" dispcond-label="A" lid="N.00008540.0001001.003"><title>Non required cabin attendant seat</title><normal-dispcond nb-required="-" rectification-interval="D"><placard/><remark><requirementblock><requirement lid="N.00008540.0001001.055" req-id="R10303"><opsproc-ref><duref product="MMEL" ref="00009017"/></opsproc-ref><maintenance-ref><taskref chap-nbr="25" func="040" product="AMM Task" sect-nbr="22" seq="001" subj-nbr="00"/></maintenance-ref><qualifiers><qualifier value="CREW_MNGT"/><qualifier value="CREW_OPS"/></qualifiers><para code="00008540.0001001.023" layer="1" lid="N.00008540.0001001.056">One or more non-required cabin attendant seats may be inoperative
